    <item>
      <title>The Accountant and the Dervish</title>
      <link>https://appapappa.com/writing/taandthed/</link>
      <pubDate>Thu, 15 Nov 2018 06:51:41 +0530</pubDate>
      <guid>https://appapappa.com/writing/taandthed/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Accountant and the Dervish&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;I note down each and every day&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;In a diary fat and blue&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;An account of the time I while away&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Doing things I shouldn&amp;rsquo;t do.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;I also keep record of tasks complete&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;A note of all I have done&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;In hand I write down clean and neat&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;A ledger of little fun.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;hr&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;I happened on a dervish today&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Living without a care&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;He smiles at what I have to say&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
